      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-334241\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">28.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/6685#21639\">Determining Stability in Other Methods</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"334241\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>For which of the following values is the implicit Euler method stable, given that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"931\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D706 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the parameter of the test equation?</p>\n<p></p><ol class=\"questionStatements\"><li> <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"932\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D706 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </li><li> <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"933\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><