mstyle><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D423 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">i</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">j</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1560\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the arc of the ellipse <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1561\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> traversed from the point <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1562\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> to the point <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1563\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyHard\">H</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Sun, Oct 11th @ 3:42 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:02</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "dom_id": "question-124278",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14111253/assets/4d83f771aa650879909c33d7033e80ca044b7e6f8369e19667e6173aa8a40737.png)\n\nEvaluate ${\\int }_{C}(x+\\sqrt{3y})\\,\\text{d}y,$ where $C$ is the path traversed along the line segment from the point $(2,0)$ to the point $(0,3),$ as shown above.",
      "worked_solution": "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(r(t))\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nThe curve $C$ is a line segment with endpoints $(2,0)$ and $(0,3).$ It can be parametrized as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(t) & =⟨(2+t(0-2)),\\,(0+t(3-0))⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2-2t,\\,3t⟩,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $0\\le t\\le 1.$\n\nComputing $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t},$ we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3t)=3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $f(x,y)=x+\\sqrt{3y}$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(t)) & =(2-2t)+\\sqrt{3(3t)} \\\\  & =2-2t+3\\sqrt{t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now evaluate the integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}f(r(t))\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(2-2t+3\\sqrt{t})\\cdot 3\\cdot \\text{d}t \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{0}^{1}(2-2t+3{t}^{1/2})\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =3{[2t-{t}^{2}+2{t}^{3/2}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =3[(2(1)-(1)^{2}+2(1)^{3/2})-(0)] \\\\  & =3(3) \\\\  & =9\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": "Correct",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-124278\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">50.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/2109#9521\">Evaluating Line Integrals With Respect to X and Y</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"124278\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img class=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-124278\"></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Evaluate <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1576\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.896em; margin-left: -0.388em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mrow space=\"2\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28 TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msqrt space=\"3\"><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.22em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-msqrt><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29 TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi></msqrt><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> where <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1577\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the path traversed along the line segment from the point <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1578\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> to the point <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1579\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"tr