ttained? </p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Sun, Oct 11th @ 4:00 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 5:40</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
