iv></div></div>.</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Sun, Oct 11th @ 4:17 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 5:19</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
