      "problem": "Find the value of the double sum\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{15}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{12}3{a}_{i}(4-{b}_{j})\n$$\n\ngiven that\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{15}{a}_{i}=30,\\,{\\sum }_{j=1}^{12}{b}_{j}=45.\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "The product rule for double summations states that\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{a}_{i}{b}_{j}={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{a}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{b}_{j}.\n$$\n\nSo, using the product rule for double summations, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{15}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{12}3{a}_{i}(4-{b}_{j}) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{15}3{a}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{12}(4-{b}_{j}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the rules for single summations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{15}3{a}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{12}(4-{b}_{j}) & =(3{\\sum }_{i=1}^{15}{a}_{i})\\cdot ({\\sum }_{j=1}^{12}4-{\\sum }_{j=1}^{12}{b}_{j}) \\\\  & =(3{\\sum }_{i=1}^{15}{a}_{i})\\cdot (4{\\sum }_{j=1}^{12}1-{\\sum }_{j=1}^{12}{b}_{j}) \\\\  & =(3\\cdot 30)\\cdot (4\\cdot 12-45) \\\\  & =(90)\\cdot (48-45) \\\\  & =(90)\\cdot (3) \\\\  & =270\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": "Correct",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-149725\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">75.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/1983#10521\">Applying the Product Rule and Swap Rules</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"149725\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Find the value of the double sum</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"2078\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-munderover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.184em; padding-left: 0.368em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-over><mjx-box><mjx-munder><mjx-row><mjx-base><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2211 TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-base></mjx-row><mjx-row><mjx-under style=\"padding-top: 0.167em; padding-left: 0.148em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-under></mjx-row></mjx-munder></mjx-box></mjx-munderover><mjx-munderover space=\"2\"><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.2em; padding-left: 0.368em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-over><mjx-box><mjx-munder><mjx-row><mjx-base><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2211 TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-base></mjx-row><mjx-row><mjx-under style=\"padding-top: 0.167em; padding-left: 0.124em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\